      "reason": "The tables report follow-up time points for individual studies (e.g. 1, 3, 6 months; 3, 6, 9, 12 months; 24 months), linking some outcomes to specific study measurement time frames. However, there is no explicit, comprehensive statement specifying the time frame of measurement for each outcome domain across the review, so reporting of time frames is only partial."
